WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.800
The merchant workspace connects conversation and native shop tools.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:13.700
The catalogue intake offers CSV, source URLs and sample product descriptions.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:20.800
See sources, catalogue knowledge and the available shop connections together.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:27.700
Open the source or test view from the same knowledge workspace.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.800
A product or shop URL opens the existing catalogue intake.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:41.700
Review the observed product data before it enters the native catalogue.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:48.800
Provide a shop URL, screenshot or design reference in the shop editor.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:55.700
The contextual agent prepares changes for the current private design.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:02.800
The canvas connects the home page, product page and category.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:09.700
Manual editing and agent proposals remain in the same design workflow.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.800
The app assistant works with the selected app and versioned draft.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:23.700
Open the coding workflow while preserving the app definition and settings.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:30.800
The agentic commerce area brings customer scenarios into the shop context.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:37.700
Configure the test work and inspect its saved runs in the same workspace.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:46.800
Agent suggestions and manual edits follow the same reviewable route.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:55.700
Select what is published, with the native release history retained.
